1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:07,163
I'm about to record myself checking an invoice from our staffing vendor, so Ramp can learn how I review it.

2
00:00:07,666 --> 00:00:10,466
I'm checking this month's invoice from Halcyon Staffing.

3
00:00:12,459 --> 00:00:15,110
Every rate on it has to match our contract.

4
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:17,999
And nobody should be billed twice for the same week.

5
00:00:18,099 --> 00:00:20,132
Then I check each person's hours against their timecard.

6
00:00:20,232 --> 00:00:23,032
Maya is approved for 40 hours. Billed hours can't go over that.

7
00:00:26,782 --> 00:00:29,582
Sam is approved for 36.

8
00:00:29,976 --> 00:00:32,776
If anything is off, I dispute it and ask for a credit.

9
00:00:37,246 --> 00:00:40,646
When I'm done, I send the recording straight to Ramp.

10
00:00:40,846 --> 00:00:44,442
I sign in, and Ramp Teach starts learning from what I just did.

11
00:00:44,842 --> 00:00:52,458
A few seconds later it has the rules, written from my clicks and what I said.

12
00:00:52,858 --> 00:00:57,907
Now a new invoice from the same vendor lands in Bill Pay.

13
00:00:58,307 --> 00:01:00,475
The agent picks it up on its own.

14
00:01:00,875 --> 00:01:12,275
It opens the vendor portal and checks each timecard, the same way I did.

15
00:01:12,475 --> 00:01:24,275
Every step it takes shows up on the bill as it happens.

16
00:01:24,475 --> 00:01:36,603
It checks billed hours, rates and duplicate lines against the contract.

17
00:01:36,903 --> 00:01:44,059
Then it writes up what it found.

18
00:01:44,359 --> 00:01:49,759
Three problems: a rate above contract, a line billed twice, and hours over the timecard. $3,448 to credit back.

19
00:01:49,959 --> 00:01:54,008
So I dispute it. The agent never approves or pays anything on its own.

20
00:01:54,408 --> 00:02:01,599
Next, a clean invoice from the same vendor.

21
00:02:01,799 --> 00:02:07,669
Same review, sped up.

22
00:02:07,789 --> 00:02:10,589
Everything checks out, so it's ready to approve.

23
00:02:10,789 --> 00:02:17,701
One click from me, and it moves on to payment.

24
00:02:18,101 --> 00:02:21,567
Show it once. Ramp Teach handles the rest.
